Rama names brothers as Ikshvaku kshatriya forest-dwellers --- Viradha boasts Brahma boon against weapons --- Rama looses seven arrows piercing Viradha --- Rama cuts hurled spear with two arrows --- Brothers break Viradha's left and right arms --- Fallen Viradha reveals cursed gandharva Tumburu --- Viradha directs Rama to Sharabhanga nearby --- Brothers bury Viradha and regain Sita joyfully